{"pin":"BH00531","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00531","anchor":"","first_line":"Praise, thanksgiving, glorification and eulogy befit the one peerless Object of all desire, Who hath illumined the world of existence with the light of justice [3.5s]... ...I beseech Thee, O my God, by all the transcendent glory of Thy Name, to clothe Thy loved ones in the robe of justice and to illumine their beings with the light of trustworthiness… In most of Our Tablets We have counselled the servants of God to be trustworthy and righteous","first_line_orig":"شکر و حمد ذکر و ثنا نعت و بها مقصود یکتا را سزا که عالم وجود را بنور عدل منور فرمود  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"1410","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA15:149","source":"INBA15","locator":"149","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v015/?page=75"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA26:149","source":"INBA26","locator":"149","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v026/?page=75"},{"kind":"music","code":"jeph.ilosopher","source":"jeph","locator":"ilosopher","url":"https://jeph.bandcamp.com/track/robe-of-justice"},{"kind":"publication","code":"COMP_TRUSTP#08x","source":"COMP_TRUSTP","locator":"08x","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/trustworthiness_compilation_originals.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"COMP_TRUSTP#37x","source":"COMP_TRUSTP","locator":"37x","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/trustworthiness_compilation_originals.pdf"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BPRY.173x","source":"BPRY","locator":"173x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/793322037"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_TRUST#08x","source":"BRL_TRUST","locator":"08x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/689295966"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_TRUST#36x","source":"BRL_TRUST","locator":"36x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/898855015"},{"kind":"translation","code":"COC#2020x","source":"COC","locator":"2020x","url":"http://bahai-library.com/compilation_trustworthiness#2020"},{"kind":"translation","code":"COC#2048x